Error [E0065]: This function uses the retired `::` body marker.
  --> tests/ui/arg_label_required.jet:1:79
    |
  1 | fn connect(host: String, /, *, timeout: Int = 30, tls: Bool = true) => String :: "{host}"
    |                                                                               ^^
 Why: A one-expression function body uses `:>`; `::` binds a name, and `=` fills a slot inside a definition.
 Fix: Replace `::` with `:>`; `jet fmt` applies this fix.

Error [E0769]: `timeout` is a label-only parameter of `connect`
  --> tests/ui/arg_label_required.jet:3:33
    |
  3 |     _ :: connect("db.internal", 5)
    |                                 ^
 Why: the `*` in the declaration requires the label, so the call says what the value means
 Fix: write `timeout: …` for this argument
